DTEND:20261029T063500
SUMMARY:Day 1 Morning: The count begins
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nToday y
 ou only count. Every lie\, every exaggeration\, every "yeah\, I did" that 
 wasn't true. No fixing\, no beating yourself up. Keep a tally in your phon
 e notes as it happens.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ h
 appens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior chang
 es your behavior. The nightly ledger is the written record\, and the weekl
 y review compares your numbers week to week. You can also enter your three
  numbers on each day in this guide. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological 
 Bulletin)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 1 Morning: The count begins
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
