SUMMARY:Day 2 Evening Ledger
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: Which type showed up most? What does that 
 tell you that you're protecting?\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies told toda
 y (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n3. Corrections m
 ade (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, and the fear (fai
 lure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: "If 
 I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when I tol
 d the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If ___\, 
 then I'll say ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
