DTSTART:20261031T063000
DTEND:20261031T063500
SUMMARY:Day 3 Morning: Where and when
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nNote wh
 ere you are and what time it is each time you lie today: at home\, at work
 \, on the phone\, by text\, tired\, rushed\, after a mistake.\n\nBefore yo
 u go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy
  it works: You can do CBT on your own. Doing it alone works if you keep sh
 owing up. The daily reminders and the nightly ledger are your structure. T
 he biggest risk is quitting\, so the plan is built around never missing tw
 o nights in a row. (Karyotaki et al. (2017)\, JAMA Psychiatry)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 3 Morning: Where and when
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
