UID:truth-ledger-9@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T233650Z
DTSTART:20261101T063000
DTEND:20261101T063500
SUMMARY:Day 4 Morning: Who gets the lies
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nNotice 
 who you lie to most. Write their names as it happens: wife\, boss\, kids\,
  friends\, parents\, yourself.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "
 If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Trying to look compe
 tent or likable makes people lie more. Your two fears\, failing and not be
 ing accepted\, are exactly these two goals. Week 2 teaches you to notice w
 hich one is running in the moment. (Feldman\, Forrest & Happ (2002)\, Basi
 c and Applied Social Psychology)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 4 Morning: Who gets the lies
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
