SUMMARY:Day 6 Morning: The cost
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nWrite a
  specific list of what lying has cost you: trust\, peace\, money\, time\, 
 closeness\, sleep\, respect for yourself. Names and moments\, not general 
 ideas.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'
 ll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Lying less goes with better health and relat
 ionships. The payoff of this work isn't only your marriage. You should als
 o start to feel better. (Kelly & Wang (2012)\, American Psychological Asso
 ciation convention)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 6 Morning: The cost
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
