SUMMARY:Week 1 review
DESCRIPTION:WEEKLY REVIEW (20 min)\nAdd up this week's ledgers: lies told\
 , lies caught\, corrections made. Compare them with last week. Find the si
 tuation that beat you most\, and write a new if-then plan for it.\n\nNext 
 week: The Fear Underneath. Most men lie out of fear of failing or fear of 
 not being accepted. This week you find exactly where those fears live and 
 what lying has been buying you.
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Week 1 review
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
