SUMMARY:Day 12 Morning: What lying pays you
DESCRIPTION:Week 2: The Fear Underneath. Every lie is protecting something
 .\n\nBe honest: lying pays. It buys relief\, approval\, time and escape. E
 ach time today\, name the payoff you were after.\n\nBefore you go\, write 
 today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Co
 mpulsive lying is real\, and there is no proven cure yet. This guide is bu
 ilt from CBT tools that work for similar problems\, arranged so one man ca
 n do the work on his own\, every day. (Curtis & Hart (2020)\, Psychiatric 
 Research and Clinical Practice)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 12 Morning: What lying pays you
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
