DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: Which payoff will you have to give up to s
 top? What will you do with that feeling instead?\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1
 . Lies told today (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n
 3. Corrections made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, a
 nd the fear (failure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story 
 in my head: "If I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually hap
 pened when I told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-
 then: "If ___\, then I'll say ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
