SUMMARY:Week 2 review
DESCRIPTION:WEEKLY REVIEW (20 min)\nAdd up this week's ledgers: lies told\
 , lies caught\, corrections made. Compare them with last week. Find the si
 tuation that beat you most\, and write a new if-then plan for it.\n\nNext 
 week: The Pause. The lie usually leaves your mouth before you've decided a
 nything. This week you build a gap between the urge and the words.
