SUMMARY:Day 21 Morning: Week 3 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 3: The Pause. Lies are fast. Truth needs three seconds.\n
 \nRead your top three lie situations from Day 3.\n\nBefore you go\, write 
 today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Tr
 acking your behavior changes your behavior. The nightly ledger is the writ
 ten record\, and the weekly review compares your numbers week to week. You
  can also enter your three numbers on each day in this guide. (Harkin et a
 l. (2016)\, Psychological Bulletin)
