 , lies caught\, corrections made. Compare them with last week. Find the si
 tuation that beat you most\, and write a new if-then plan for it.\n\nNext 
 week: Replace the Lie. A habit breaks when a new response takes its place.
  This week you write and rehearse the true sentences you'll say in the mom
 ents you used to lie.
