UID:truth-ledger-66@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261028T233650Z
DTSTART:20261119T063000
DTEND:20261119T063500
SUMMARY:Day 22 Morning: Write your if-then plans
DESCRIPTION:Week 4: Replace the Lie. You can't just stop. You have to say 
 something else.\n\nWrite five if-then plans for your top lie situations: "
 If she asks whether I finished it\, then I say exactly how far I got." "If
  someone asks what I paid\, then I say the real number." Save them in your
  phone.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I
 'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: If-then plans work. Every morning you write
  one if-then plan for the day's risk moment: "If she asks about the money\
 , then I'll say the real number." (Gollwitzer & Sheeran (2006)\, Advances 
 in Experimental Social Psychology)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 22 Morning: Write your if-then plans
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
