SUMMARY:Day 28 Morning: Week 4 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 4: Replace the Lie. You can't just stop. You have to say 
 something else.\n\nRead all your if-then plans this morning.\n\nBefore you
  go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy 
 it works: Tracking your behavior changes your behavior. The nightly ledger
  is the written record\, and the weekly review compares your numbers week 
 to week. You can also enter your three numbers on each day in this guide. 
 (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological Bulletin)
