 them teaches you that the truth is survivable. Each lie you don't tell is 
 a test of your prediction. The prediction test (Day 13) and the truth ladd
 er (Week 5) are behavioral experiments. (Clark & Wells cognitive model\; M
 organ & Raffle (1999)\; Salkovskis)
