SUMMARY:Day 35 Morning: Week 5 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 5: Small Truths\, Out Loud. Courage is a muscle. Train it
  light first.\n\nLook at your ladder. Mark every rung you've climbed.\n\nB
 efore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___.
 "\n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior changes your behavior. The night
 ly ledger is the written record\, and the weekly review compares your numb
 ers week to week. You can also enter your three numbers on each day in thi
 s guide. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological Bulletin)
