SUMMARY:Day 36 Morning: Money
DESCRIPTION:Week 6: Hard Truths. Tell the truth where it costs the most.\n
 \nMoney attracts lies. Today\, tell the exact truth about every money ques
 tion: what it cost\, where it went\, what you owe.\n\nBefore you go\, writ
 e today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: 
 Secrets weigh on you even when nobody is asking. The lies you're still sta
 nding behind cost you every day\, not just when you're questioned. That's 
 why Week 6 has you start taking old lies down\, one at a time. (Slepian\, 
 Chun & Mason (2017)\, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology)
