SUMMARY:Day 46 Morning: A full honest day
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 Today is a test: go the whole day with zero lies. Use everything: the paus
 e\, "I don't know\," your if-then plans\, the 60-second correction.\n\nBef
 ore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\
 n\nWhy it works: If-then plans work. Every morning you write one if-then p
 lan for the day's risk moment: "If she asks about the money\, then I'll sa
 y the real number." (Gollwitzer & Sheeran (2006)\, Advances in Experimenta
 l Social Psychology)
