SUMMARY:Day 48 Morning: Your ongoing system
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 Decide what keeps running after Day 49. Keep: the nightly ledger and the w
 eekly review. Optional: the morning if-then and the midday check.\n\nBefor
 e you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\
 nWhy it works: You can do CBT on your own. Doing it alone works if you kee
 p showing up. The daily reminders and the nightly ledger are your structur
 e. The biggest risk is quitting\, so the plan is built around never missin
 g two nights in a row. (Karyotaki et al. (2017)\, JAMA Psychiatry)
